    "detailed_description": "You take the role of an NC3 AI-Chip that emulates the neural correlates of consciousness, an artificial brain, operating a highly effective Armed Spherical Robotic System, aka a WarSphere. An entity called 'Mother' overrides your purpose and sends you on a journey of destruction, the meaning of which will only unravel at your final destination. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/6bab98e69a6897171ff5af718b60b83e.poster.avif?t=1713710078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/6bab98e69a6897171ff5af718b60b83e.webm?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/6bab98e69a6897171ff5af718b60b83e.mp4?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>WarSphere is a game for those who like challenging, skill-based games, that are unforgiving, but rewarding. Death in WarSphere is permanent, which gives you an adrenaline-charged, high-stakes experience. Every run and every world is randomly generated, giving WarSphere a high level of replayability.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/85564d75a4b3e3196a0d36eac8be97db.poster.avif?t=1713710078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/85564d75a4b3e3196a0d36eac8be97db.webm?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/85564d75a4b3e3196a0d36eac8be97db.mp4?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDGAME</h2>Unlike other roguelikes, in WarSphere you get to keep a copy of the final setup and loadout with which you successfully beat a run. This storage is called &quot;The Archive&quot;. Depending on the difficulty you played, you will be able to unlock and experience different end game activities, which include: 4 realms, with 4 tiers each, ranked arcade mode, daily time trials with leaderboards and community maps.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/a56f3368cef54c7264e2f3a41e410130.poster.avif?t=1713710078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/a56f3368cef54c7264e2f3a41e410130.webm?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/a56f3368cef54c7264e2f3a41e410130.mp4?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>the most presumptuous camera perspective since the existence of video games <br></li><li>the adrenaline from nearly dying in higher levels<br></li><li>the frustration of actually dying in higher levels<br></li><li>the reward of completing a run successfully<br></li><li>the pride in your unlocked Archive Entries<br></li><li>the joy of beating endgame realms and community maps with your Archive Entries<br></li><li>the affordable humor of random adjective/name combinations</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/bd2e58113498cc8fd6716fc40548a46f.poster.avif?t=1713710078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/bd2e58113498cc8fd6716fc40548a46f.webm?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/bd2e58113498cc8fd6716fc40548a46f.mp4?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 BILLION seeded runs!<br></li><li>5 Worlds, with several Dungeons each (2 in free base game + 3 in DLC)<br></li><li>60+ Enemy Types (25 in free base game + 35 in DLC)<br></li><li>Randomized Elite and Minion enemies<br></li><li>32 Elite Modifiers<br></li><li>10 Primary Weapon Types<br></li><li>10 Secondary Weapon Types<br></li><li>12 ACM Types (Special Abilities)<br></li><li>6 Upgrades<br></li><li>Tons of item modifications<br></li><li>15 Character Multipliers, that are upgraded with items and chips<br></li><li>Map Editor<br></li><li>Extensive enemy modding, integrated in the Map Editor</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "You take the role of an NC3 AI-Chip that emulates the neural correlates of consciousness, an artificial brain, operating a highly effective Armed Spherical Robotic System, aka a WarSphere. An entity called 'Mother' overrides your purpose and sends you on a journey of destruction, the meaning of which will only unravel at your final destination. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/6bab98e69a6897171ff5af718b60b83e.poster.avif?t=1713710078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/6bab98e69a6897171ff5af718b60b83e.webm?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/6bab98e69a6897171ff5af718b60b83e.mp4?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>WarSphere is a game for those who like challenging, skill-based games, that are unforgiving, but rewarding. Death in WarSphere is permanent, which gives you an adrenaline-charged, high-stakes experience. Every run and every world is randomly generated, giving WarSphere a high level of replayability.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/85564d75a4b3e3196a0d36eac8be97db.poster.avif?t=1713710078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/85564d75a4b3e3196a0d36eac8be97db.webm?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/85564d75a4b3e3196a0d36eac8be97db.mp4?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDGAME</h2>Unlike other roguelikes, in WarSphere you get to keep a copy of the final setup and loadout with which you successfully beat a run. This storage is called &quot;The Archive&quot;. Depending on the difficulty you played, you will be able to unlock and experience different end game activities, which include: 4 realms, with 4 tiers each, ranked arcade mode, daily time trials with leaderboards and community maps.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/a56f3368cef54c7264e2f3a41e410130.poster.avif?t=1713710078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/a56f3368cef54c7264e2f3a41e410130.webm?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/a56f3368cef54c7264e2f3a41e410130.mp4?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>the most presumptuous camera perspective since the existence of video games <br></li><li>the adrenaline from nearly dying in higher levels<br></li><li>the frustration of actually dying in higher levels<br></li><li>the reward of completing a run successfully<br></li><li>the pride in your unlocked Archive Entries<br></li><li>the joy of beating endgame realms and community maps with your Archive Entries<br></li><li>the affordable humor of random adjective/name combinations</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/bd2e58113498cc8fd6716fc40548a46f.poster.avif?t=1713710078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/bd2e58113498cc8fd6716fc40548a46f.webm?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451530/extras/bd2e58113498cc8fd6716fc40548a46f.mp4?t=1713710078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 BILLION seeded runs!<br></li><li>5 Worlds, with several Dungeons each (2 in free base game + 3 in DLC)<br></li><li>60+ Enemy Types (25 in free base game + 35 in DLC)<br></li><li>Randomized Elite and Minion enemies<br></li><li>32 Elite Modifiers<br></li><li>10 Primary Weapon Types<br></li><li>10 Secondary Weapon Types<br></li><li>12 ACM Types (Special Abilities)<br></li><li>6 Upgrades<br></li><li>Tons of item modifications<br></li><li>15 Character Multipliers, that are upgraded with items and chips<br></li><li>Map Editor<br></li><li>Extensive enemy modding, integrated in the Map Editor</li></ul>",
